{"pageProps":{"title":"登録関係書類","content":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">全軟登録票</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>REGISTRATION FORM</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-488cde50-9bf8-4ca8-93cd-db6130710961\" href=\"https://wp.jsbb-fukuoka.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/69ae57921ba63.xls\">【８年度】チーム登録名簿</a></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">県連加入申込書</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>APPLICATION FOR MEMBERSHIP</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-f275f6e4-f9f2-4e7b-a6ef-7c7b22030e14\" href=\"https://wp.jsbb-fukuoka.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/69ae5a23226b2.xlsx\">８年度県連盟加入申込書（学童・少年）</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-861989a4-870b-472e-94d4-33f594b76220\" href=\"https://wp.jsbb-fukuoka.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/69ae57d5cf439.xlsx\">８年度加入申込書（一般）</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-2f143de6-4d02-452e-8de8-3ee3b0c3a671\" href=\"https://wp.jsbb-fukuoka.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/69ae57e9ec692.doc\">８年度県連盟加入申込書（成年）</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-567209d5-b671-4897-b7b1-45898c333d15\" href=\"https://wp.jsbb-fukuoka.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/69ae57f6db972.doc\">８年度県連盟加入申込書（実年）</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-f85fdfe4-6034-4b3c-bf9c-1c61b25c4956\" href=\"https://wp.jsbb-fukuoka.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/69ae582001746.doc\">８年度県連盟加入申込書（還暦）</a></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">県連登録名簿</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>REGISTERED DIRECTORY</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-4e72abfa-b14f-4412-a945-5ffc9bb72687\" href=\"https://wp.jsbb-fukuoka.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/69ae582a26ac1.xls\">8年度個人登録名簿（学童）</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-0f9365c1-39ba-4d94-84f8-6102de91a5d1\" hr